      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-325565",
      ":question/problem": "A dataset of $21$ different exam scores has a mean of $72$ and a median of $72$. A new dataset is created by adding $2$ to each score above the median and subtracting $2$ from each score below the median. Which of the following measures does **NOT** have the same value in both the original and new datasets?\n\n1. Mean\n2. Median\n3. Range\n4. Standard deviation"
    },
